## 2. Restart with the sidecar stopped
compose stop computer-egress (stopping it leaves the rules in place: v4 14, v6 7)
08:37:31 first attempt: WSL interop error "UtilAcceptVsock:271: accept4 failed 110", docker.exe never ran, nothing restarted
08:38:08 docker.exe desktop restart -> "Starting Docker Desktop"; docker up 08:38:27
  rs27-mini-computer-egress-1 exited (stopped by hand, so unless-stopped leaves it down)
  rs27-mini-supervisor-1 running started=08:38:22
rakazo-c+ rules: v4 0 (INPUT 0), v6 0          <- the rules do not survive a restart on their own
supervisor 08:38:25 "supervisor listening"; 08:38:26 error "restricted computer egress unavailable"
create (resume) rs27bot:
500 {"error":"SANDBOX_COMPUTER_EGRESS=restricted is not enforced on this Docker host: run infra/compose/restrict-computer-egress.sh on the host, or set SANDBOX_COMPUTER_EGRESS=open (see docs/self-host-docker-computers.md) (a computer bridge reached the host)"}
computer state: exited                          <- the existing computer is not resumed either

